				</li>
				<li>
					<a href="https://techcrunch.com/2026/07/07/the-coding-agent-wars-are-spilling-into-the-rest-of-the-office-claude-cowork/" class="text-teal-600 hover:text-teal-800" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Claude Cowork Expands to Mobile and Web</a> — TechCrunch, July 2026
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</PageShell>
</MainLayout>
